    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Oh my God! I can't believe my eyes! Look at these women! Will you look at the gorgeous calves on them?! I'm telling you, give me an athlete any day... Oh God! Look at that redhead over there, and look at that one! Christ, I hadn't noticed her."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 3,
        "line": 1053,
        "text": "So, I'll take the ten A.M. to three P.M. shift... And I'll take every other night... plus the walk in the park in the afternoon before I go to work... and we split the rent equally... and I'll just be 'one of the guys'... deal? PETER, MICHAEL, AND JACK Deal."
      }
    },
